          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.10+EXO.25.11+EXO.25.12+EXO.25.13+EXO.25.14+EXO.25.15+EXO.25.16+EXO.25.17+EXO.25.18+EXO.25.19+EXO.25.20+EXO.25.21+EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 25.10-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bezalel made the ark of acacia wood; two cubits and a half was its length, a cubit and a half its breadth, and a cubit and a half its height. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he overlaid it with pure gold within and without, and made a molding of gold around it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he cast for it four rings of gold for its four corners, two rings on its one side and two rings on its other side. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made poles of acacia wood, and overlaid them with gold, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and put the poles into the rings on the sides of the ark, to carry the ark. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made a mercy seat of pure gold; two cubits and a half was its length, and a cubit and a half its breadth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made two cherubim of hammered gold; on the two ends of the mercy seat he made them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one cherub on the one end, and one cherub on the other end; of one piece with the mercy seat he made the cherubim on its two ends. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The cherubim spread out their wings above, overshadowing the mercy seat with their wings, with their faces one to another; toward the mercy seat were the faces of the cherubim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
