                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He also made the table of acacia wood; two cubits was its length, a cubit its breadth, and a cubit and a half its height; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he overlaid it with pure gold, and made a molding of gold around it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made around it a frame a handbreadth wide, and made a molding of gold around the frame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He cast for it four rings of gold, and fastened the rings to the four corners at its four legs. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Close to the frame were the rings, as holders for the poles to carry the table. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He made the poles of acacia wood to carry the table, and overlaid them with gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made the vessels of pure gold which were to be upon the table, its plates and dishes for incense, and its bowls and flagons with which to pour libations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
