            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.1+EXO.30.2+EXO.30.3+EXO.30.4+EXO.30.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 30.1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He made the altar of incense of acacia wood; its length was a cubit, and its breadth was a cubit; it was square, and two cubits was its height; its horns were of one piece with it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He overlaid it with pure gold, its top, and its sides round about, and its horns; and he made a molding of gold round about it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and made two rings of gold on it under its molding, on two opposite sides of it, as holders for the poles with which to carry it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made the poles of acacia wood, and overlaid them with gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
